---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title='Book an Executive Consultation | Trouvus' description='Discuss AI strategy, business-model innovation, implementation, workforce transformation or executive education with Trouvus.'>
<section class="page-hero"><canvas class="hero-canvas" data-variant="pipeline"></canvas><div class="wrap"><div class="eyebrow">Executive consultation</div><h1>Start with the strategic problem.</h1><p class="lead">Tell us what your organization is trying to decide, change or build. We will use the first conversation to assess fit, clarify the problem and identify a credible next step.</p></div></section><section><div class="wrap contact-grid"><div><h2>What to expect</h2><p>A focused discussion of your strategic priorities, operating constraints, existing initiatives and evidence requirements.</p><div class="card"><h3>Common starting points</h3><p class="muted">AI strategy and use-case prioritization · Business-model redesign · Pilot definition · Executive education · Workforce transformation · Governance.</p></div><p><strong>Email:</strong> <a class="card-cta" href="mailto:info@trouvus.com">info@trouvus.com</a><br><strong>Phone:</strong> <a class="card-cta" href="tel:+14165785353">+1 (416) 578-5353</a></p><p class="small muted">During this private preview, the form opens a prepared message in your email application. A CRM-backed endpoint will replace it before public launch.</p></div><form data-contact-form><div class="form-row"><label for="first-name">First name <span class="required" aria-hidden="true">*</span><input id="first-name" required autocomplete="given-name" name="first_name"></label><label for="last-name">Last name <span class="required" aria-hidden="true">*</span><input id="last-name" required autocomplete="family-name" name="last_name"></label></div><label for="work-email">Work email <span class="required" aria-hidden="true">*</span><input id="work-email" required type="email" autocomplete="email" name="email"></label><label for="organization">Organization<input id="organization" autocomplete="organization" name="organization"></label><label for="role">Role<input id="role" autocomplete="organization-title" name="role"></label><label for="challenge">Primary transformation challenge<select id="challenge" name="challenge"><option>AI strategy and roadmap</option><option>Business-model innovation</option><option>Implementation or pilot</option><option>Workforce transformation</option><option>Executive education</option><option>AI venture advisory</option><option>Other</option></select></label><label for="message">What decision or outcome are you working toward? <span class="required" aria-hidden="true">*</span><textarea id="message" required name="message"></textarea></label><button class="btn accent" type="submit">Prepare consultation request</button><p class="form-status" data-form-status aria-live="polite"></p><p class="small muted">Required fields are marked with an asterisk. Your information is not stored by this preview website.</p></form></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
